WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:18.010
"Ooh!" Tom moaned.

2
00:00:18.011 --> 00:00:20.729
"My belly is so full.

3
00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:24.468
It's full of milk!"

4
00:00:24.469 --> 00:00:28.864
The mouse laughed at Tom.

5
00:00:28.865 --> 00:00:32.896
"There is still milk on the floor," she said.

6
00:00:32.897 --> 00:00:45.152
"Keep drinking, Tom!"

7
00:00:45.153 --> 00:00:54.225
Just then the farmer's wife came back.

8
00:00:54.226 --> 00:00:58.584
"Eek!" she yelled. "A mouse!

9
00:00:58.585 --> 00:01:01.272
There's a mouse in the kitchen!"

10
00:01:01.273 --> 00:01:05.130
"Ahh!" The mouse squeaked.

11
00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:10.839
She ran fast to her hole.

12
00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:13.446
Tom ran after the mouse.

13
00:01:13.447 --> 00:01:15.780
But Tom was too big.

14
00:01:15.781 --> 00:01:17.479
Smash!

15
00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:20.132
Tom bumped his nose on the wall.

16
00:01:20.133 --> 00:01:25.952
"Ouch!" he said.

17
00:01:25.953 --> 00:01:28.332
The farmer's wife clapped.

18
00:01:28.333 --> 00:01:33.421
"Good cat!" she cried.

19
00:01:33.422 --> 00:01:40.779
"You chased that mouse away!"

20
00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:47.995
The farmer's wife went to the pantry.

21
00:01:47.996 --> 00:01:50.228
"Here," she said.

22
00:01:50.229 --> 00:01:54.364
"I have a treat for you."

23
00:01:54.365 --> 00:01:58.346
The farmer's wife held out a dish.

24
00:01:58.347 --> 00:02:02.682
Tom looked at it.

25
00:02:02.683 --> 00:02:12.540
"Ugh," Tom thought. "Milk!"
